fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#GstAppSinkNewPrerollCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSinkNewPrerollCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewPrerollCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkNewPrerollCallback\n\nCalled when a new preroll sample is available. This callback is called from\nthe streaming thread. The new preroll sample can be retrieved with\ngst_app_sink_pull_preroll either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\ncallback user data\nGST_FLOW_OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new preroll sample is available. This callback is called from\nthe streaming thread. The new preroll sample can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.prototype.pull_preroll either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\nGst.FlowReturn.OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when a new preroll sample is available. This callback is called from\nthe streaming thread. The new preroll sample can be retrieved with\nGstApp.AppSink.pull_preroll either from this callback or from any other\nthread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\ncallback user data\nGst.FlowReturn.OK on success.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});